meta {
  name: Get Accreditation & Affiliation
  type: http
  seq: 3
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/student/compare/colleges/{{collegeId}}/accreditation
  body: none
  auth: bearer
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{studentAccessToken}}
}

docs {
  Accreditation & Affiliation section — parent university, university
  type, accreditation, institution group name, sibling colleges in the
  same institution group (if any), and accolade badges.

  Response `data`:
  {
    universityName, universityType, accreditation, institutionGroupName,
    affiliatedColleges, courseAccreditations,
    "accolades": [
      { "tag": "NAAC A+", "image": "", "title": "Accredited with A+ grade by NAAC (2023)" },
      { "tag": "NIRF Rank 3", "image": "", "title": "India's top ranked institutions 2024" }
    ]
  }

  `accolades` is sourced from the college's own `college_overview.accolades`
  profile section (college-admin Setup > Profile > College Overview) —
  same data already surfaced on the University Details compare screen, now
  also included here. `[]` if none configured yet.
}
